expect:    top_resource ranked rows differ from hand truth
rationale: Removes LIMIT after deterministic ordering. The golden case carries rows beyond the
           cut, so returning the complete ranking must not be mistaken for a valid top report.
---
--- a/tests/oracle/families/top.py
+++ b/tests/oracle/families/top.py
@@ -49,3 +49,3 @@
     ))
-    return ranked if limit is None else ranked[:limit]
+    return ranked
 
